 award_xp                     | _user uuid, _amount integer, _reason text, _ref uuid | t                | v          | search_path=public          | CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.award_xp(_user uuid, _amount integer, _reason text, _ref uuid)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             |  RETURNS void                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
