 mark_questions_used          | _ids uuid[]                                          | t                | v          | search_path=public          | CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.mark_questions_used(_ids uuid[])                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             |  RETURNS void                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             |  LANGUAGE sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             |  SECURITY DEFINER                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             |  SET search_path TO 'public'                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             | AS $function$                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
