 plan_rank                    | _plan text                                           | f                | i          | -                           | CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.plan_rank(_plan text)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             |  RETURNS integer                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             |  LANGUAGE sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             |  IMMUTABLE                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             | AS $function$                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             |   SELECT CASE _plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             |     WHEN 'free' THEN 0                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             |     WHEN 'starter' THEN 1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             |     WHEN 'pro' THEN 2                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             |     WHEN 'expert' THEN 3                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             |     WHEN 'teste' THEN 99                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             |     ELSE 0                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             |   END;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                              |                                                      |                  |            |                             | $function$                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
